  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다. </span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요. </span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p><br></p><p>예전 팝업활동지에 관한 글이구요.&nbsp; <a href=\"http://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/IDO/14\">http://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/IDO/14</a></p><p><br></p><p>예전 이재호 선생님께서 올려주신 중위도 지방의 아이디어를 옮겨 담았습니다.</p><p><br></p><p>극지방도 비슷하게 수정을 하였더니 더 알아보기가 좋네요.</p><p><br></p><p>시간 여유가 된다면 좀 더 깨끗하게 그림을 만들고 싶은....마음이 큽니다 ㅠㅅㅠ 하....;;;</p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHv%26dataid%3D1506%26fileid%3D8%26regdt%3D20160623165620&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile271.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F2763DB44576B959B11C803')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/editor/icon/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> popup-2016.hwp</a></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/223F9C42576B94441C\" class=\"txc-image\" actualwidth=\"400\" width=\"400\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"제목 없음.png\" /></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">아래 형광펜으로 칠한 부분을 잘라줍니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2775F546576B948313\" class=\"txc-image\" actualwidth=\"640\" width=\"640\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"KakaoTalk_20160620_145447202.jpg\" /></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2367E146576B948421\" class=\"txc-image\" actualwidth=\"640\" width=\"640\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"KakaoTalk_20160620_145447957.jpg\" /></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/234FBC46576B948437\" class=\"txc-image\" actualwidth=\"640\" width=\"640\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"KakaoTalk_20160620_145448399.jpg\" /></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">그럼 아래 사진처럼&nbsp;접어서 관측자 입장에서 예상해봅니다.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/23707E46576B948419\" class=\"txc-image\" actualwidth=\"640\" width=\"640\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"KakaoTalk_20160620_145448982.jpg\" /></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/27640446576B948524\" class=\"txc-image\" actualwidth=\"640\" width=\"640\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"KakaoTalk_20160620_145449487.jpg\" /></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/25516446576B948536\" class=\"txc-image\" actualwidth=\"640\" width=\"640\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"KakaoTalk_20160620_145451043.jpg\" /></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p></div><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
